  "blocks": {
    "\"Different harnesses — Claude Code has filesystem tools, a different system prompt, and a permission layer. The model isn't the variable here.\"": "“因为运行框架不同——Claude Code 拥有<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/filesystem\">文件系统</a>工具、不同的系统提示词和权限层。这里的变量不是模型。”",
    "\"Same model, why is Claude Code editing files and Claude.ai just answering questions?\"": "“明明是同一个模型，为什么 Claude Code 会编辑文件，Claude.ai 却只回答问题？”",
    "Everything around the model that turns it into an agent: tools, system prompt, context-window management, permissions, hooks. Claude.ai and Claude Code run on the same model but behave differently because their harnesses differ.": "运行框架是包围<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model\">模型</a>、把它变成<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>的一切：<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool\">工具</a>、<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/system-prompt\">系统提示词</a>、<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-window\">上下文窗口</a>管理、权限和钩子。Claude.ai 与 Claude Code 使用相同模型，却表现不同，原因就在于运行框架不同。",
    "Examples: Claude Code, Cursor, Codex CLI — and Claude.ai, which is a chat harness rather than a coding one.": "典型运行框架包括 Claude Code、Cursor、Codex CLI，以及面向聊天而非编码的 Claude.ai。",
    "The model itself only does one thing: take text in, produce text out. It can't read a file, run a command, or remember the last turn. The harness supplies all of that. It assembles the context for each model provider request, executes the tool calls the model asks for, feeds the tool results back in, stores the session history, asks you for permission before risky actions, and decides when to compact. The agent loop — model proposes, harness executes, repeat — is run by the harness.": "模型本身只做一件事：接收文本，再生成文本。它不能读取文件、运行命令，也无法记住上一个<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/turn\">轮次</a>。这些能力全由运行框架提供。运行框架为每次<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model-provider-request\">模型提供商请求</a>组装<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context\">上下文</a>，执行模型提出的<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool-call\">工具调用</a>，把<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool-result\">工具结果</a>反馈回去，保存<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/session\">会话</a>历史，在高风险操作前请求你的许可，并决定何时进行<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/compaction\">压缩</a>。智能体循环——模型提出操作、运行框架执行、再次重复——也是由运行框架驱动的。",
    "This matters for diagnosis. When behaviour differs between two products, or between yesterday and today, the model is often not the variable — the harness is. A different system prompt, a different set of tools, a changed permission default, or a new context-management strategy all change behaviour without any change to the model. It also means the harness is where most of your configuration lives: AGENTS.md files, permission settings, and hooks are all instructions to the harness, not the model.": "这一点对故障诊断十分重要。当两个产品之间，或昨天与今天之间的行为发生变化时，变量往往不是模型，而是运行框架。不同的系统提示词、不同的工具集、修改后的默认权限，或新的上下文管理策略，都能在模型完全不变的情况下改变行为。这也意味着，大部分配置其实属于运行框架：<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agents-md\">AGENTS.md</a> 文件、权限设置和钩子，都是给运行框架的指令，而不是给模型本体的指令。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>"
  },
